    uncomfortType: 0
  - cn: "\u4ECA\u5929\u7684\u8F7D\u5177\u4E5F\u72B6\u6001\u826F\u597D\uFF0C\u8BF7\u653E\u5FC3\u3002"
    en: The vehicle is still in good condition today. Please do not worry.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 4
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
  - cn: "\u53EA\u8981\u6211\u4EEC\u80FD\u627E\u5230\u8DEF\u7EBF\u6216\u8005\u63A5\u6536\u5230\u4EFB\u4F55\u4FE1\u53F7\u5C31\u53EF\u4EE5\u7ACB\u523B\u5168\u901F\u51FA\u53D1\u3002"
    en: As long as we find a route or receive any signal, we can set out at full
      speed immediately.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 4
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
  - cn: "\u4F46\u5728\u8FD9\u4E4B\u524D\u6211\u4EEC\u53EA\u80FD\u5C3D\u529B\u8282\u7701\u71C3\u6599\u3002"
    en: But before that, we can only do our best to save fuel.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
  - cn: "\u4F60\u5DF2\u7ECF\u505A\u7684\u5F88\u597D\u4E86\u3002"
    en: You are already doing very well.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 1
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
  - cn: "\u8C22\u8C22\u4F60\uFF0C\u961F\u957F\u3002"
    en: Thank you, Captain.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
